ectories, promotions, emergency alerts) while static elements provide permanent branding. Engineered for high wind loads with concrete foundation specifications included.\", \"sku\": \"BL-WF-PL01\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/pylon-led-wayfinding-sign\", \"category\": \"signage-solutions\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_pylon-led-wayfinding-sign.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/pylon-led-wayfinding-sign\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"4mm / 6mm options\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"7,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the available pixel pitch options and how do they affect display quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Pylon LED Wayfinding Sign offers 4mm and 6mm pixel pitch options. A 4mm pitch provides higher resolution, making it ideal for closer viewing distances, while 6mm suits longer ranges with lower pixel density, balancing cost and clarity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements and can you provide foundation specifications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation involves securing the steel galvanized structure to a concrete foundation engineered for wind loads up to 120mph. We supply detailed foundation specs to ensure stability and safety for heights ranging from 10ft to 30ft.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the display and is it suitable for direct sunlight?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 7,000 nits, this LED display is designed for high visibility even under direct sunlight, making it perfect for outdoor wayfinding in brightly lit environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What content management options are available for the LED screen?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The LED panel supports 4G and WiFi connectivity and is managed via a cloud-based CMS. This enables real-time updates of directories, promotions, or emergency alerts remotely and efficiently.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx provide?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Our Pylon LED Wayfinding Signs come with a standard manufacturer warranty covering hardware and LED performance, alongside dedicated customer support ensuring prompt assistance and maintenance guidance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the pylon sign compare to traditional static wayfinding signs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike static signs, this pylon integrates dynamic LED displays that can be updated remotely, allowing for versatile messaging such as promotions, alerts, or directory changes, increasing engagement and adaptability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the structure engineered for extreme weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the galvanized steel structure is engineered to withstand wind speeds up to 120mph. This provides reliable performance in harsh outdoor conditions common in the GCC and Middle East regions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments is this LED pylon best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product is ideal for high-traffic outdoor environments like shopping centers, business parks, and campuses where visible, dynamic wayfinding and communication are essential for visitors.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Pylon LED Wayfinding Sign\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/pylon-led-wayfinding-sign\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Pylon LED Wayfinding Sign</h1><p>Effective Pylon LED Wayfinding Sign solutions in Dubai. Direct visitors smoothly with Brightluxx’s advanced LED signs. Contact us for customized designs!</p><p><strong>Tall outdoor wayfinding pylon with LED display integration.</strong></p><p>Monumental outdoor wayfinding pylon combining static signage with integrated LED display panel. Heights from 10ft to 30ft. LED section displays dynamic content (directories, promotions, emergency alerts) while static elements provide permanent branding. Engineered for high wind loads with concrete foundation specifications included.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the available pixel pitch options and how do they affect display quality?</h3><p>The Pylon LED Wayfinding Sign offers 4mm and 6mm pixel pitch options. A 4mm pitch provides higher resolution, making it ideal for closer viewing distances, while 6mm suits longer ranges with lower pixel density, balancing cost and clarity.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements and can you provide foundation specifications?</h3><p>Installation involves securing the steel galvanized structure to a concrete foundation engineered for wind loads up to 120mph. We supply detailed foundation specs to ensure stability and safety for heights ranging from 10ft to 30ft.</p><h3>How bright is the display and is it suitable for direct sunlight?</h3><p>With a brightness of 7,000 nits, this LED display is designed for high visibility even under direct sunlight, making it perfect for outdoor wayfinding in brightly lit environments.</p><h3>What content management options are available for the LED screen?</h3><p>The LED panel supports 4G and WiFi connectivity and is managed via a cloud-based CMS. This enables real-time updates of directories, promotions, or emergency alerts remotely and efficiently.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"pylon-led-wayfinding-sign\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/pylon-led-wayfinding-sign\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$