r closer viewing distances, while 6mm suits longer ranges with lower pixel density, balancing cost and clarity.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat are the installation requirements and can you provide foundation specifications?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eInstallation involves securing the steel galvanized structure to a concrete foundation engineered for wind loads up to 120mph. We supply detailed foundation specs to ensure stability and safety for heights ranging from 10ft to 30ft.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the display and is it suitable for direct sunlight?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith a brightness of 7,000 nits, this LED display is designed for high visibility even under direct sunlight, making it perfect for outdoor wayfinding in brightly lit environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat content management options are available for the LED screen?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe LED panel supports 4G and WiFi connectivity and is managed via a cloud-based CMS. This enables real-time updates of directories, promotions, or emergency alerts remotely and efficiently.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Pylon LED Wayfinding Sign | Outdoor Navigation Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Effective Pylon LED Wayfinding Sign solutions in Dubai. Direct visitors smoothly with Brightluxx’s advanced LED signs. Contact us for customized designs!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/pylon-led-wayfinding-sign\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></htm