wer\", \"text\": \"Our Pylon LED Wayfinding Signs come with a standard manufacturer warranty covering hardware and LED performance, alongside dedicated customer support ensuring prompt assistance and maintenance guidance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the pylon sign compare to traditional static wayfinding signs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike static signs, this pylon integrates dynamic LED displays that can be updated remotely, allowing for versatile messaging such as promotions, alerts, or directory changes, increasing engagement and adaptability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the structure engineered for extreme weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the galvanized steel structure is engineered to withstand wind speeds up to 120mph. This provides reliable performance in harsh outdoor conditions common in the GCC and Middle East regions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments is this LED pylon best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product is ideal for high-traffic outdoor environments like shopping centers, business parks, and campuses where visible, dynamic wayfinding and communication are essential for visitors.\"}}]}a:X\nf:X\nf:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$3\"}}],\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],\"$L7\"]}],null,\"$L8\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@9\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lb\",\"isPartial\":\"$@c\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Ld\",\"isPartial\":\"$@e\",\"staleTime\":\"$